OL,3,GNEWSAFlagship ferry repair project to
OL,4,Acost about #5m
OL,5,
OL,6,FA project to repair the Isle of Man's
OL,7,Fflagship ferry is expected to cost
OL,8,Fabout #5m, the operator has said.
OL,10,FDamage to the Manxman was discovered
OL,11,Fwhen the vessel entered drydock for
OL,12,Fscheduled maintenance on 13 July,
OL,13,Fleaving it out of action until late
OL,14,FNovember.
OL,16,FThe Isle of Man Steam Packet Company
OL,17,Fsaid the shaft bearings and associated
OL,18,Fshaft liners, which protect the
OL,19,Fvessel's main propulsion shafts, had
OL,20,Fnow been repaired by a specialist
OL,21,Fengineering firm in Denmark.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB IOM NewsC Reg TVF Clean Feed
FL,449,445,260,140,0,100
