OL,3,GNEWSAFlagship ferry repair project to
OL,4,Acost about #5m
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Steam Packet said the cost of the
OL,7,Fwork would be paid for directly from
OL,8,Fthe firm's reserves without additional
OL,9,Ffunding from the government.
